*.log
# Database dumps. A legacy export of this system carried staff names, csc.gov.ph
# addresses and password hashes; once committed it stays in the history even
# after deletion. Migration source data belongs out of band, not in the repo —
# config/database.php defines a read-only `legacy` connection for that.
